  <link:footnoteLink xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link" xlink:type="extended">
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the three months ended March 31, 2026 we recorded Debits to account 403.1 totaling $409 and Credits of the same amount to account 108.&#160;Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 403.1 totaling $409 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 403.1 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the three months ended March 31, 2026 we recorded Debits to account 411.10 totaling $14,436 and Credits of the same amount to account 230.&#160;Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 411.10 totaling $14,436 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 411.10 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the three months ended March 31, 2025 we recorded Debits to account 403.1 totaling $677 and Credits of the same amount to account 108.&#160;Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 403.1 totaling $677 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 403.1 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-4" id="fn-4" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the three months ended March 31, 2025 we recorded Debits to account 411.10 totaling $20,923 and Credits of the same amount to account 230.&#160;Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 411.10 totaling $20,923 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 411.10 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-5" id="fn-5" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
